1
00:00:00,364 --> 00:00:01,824
(Sheldon:)Wow, this is hard.

2
00:00:02,825 --> 00:00:06,615
They got me a motorized dirt bike.

3
00:00:08,372 --> 00:00:09,412
(Penny:)No.

4
00:00:09,999 --> 00:00:13,589
What 12-year-old boy
wants a motorized dirt bike?

5
00:00:14,378 --> 00:00:15,758
(Penny:)All of them.

6
00:00:15,921 --> 00:00:17,421
- Really?
- Yeah.

7
00:00:19,091 --> 00:00:20,261
(Sheldon:)Huh.

8
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:22,970
(Penny:)- So we're getting this one?
- Yeah, I suppose.

9
00:00:23,137 --> 00:00:24,847
All right, let's go.

10
00:00:25,014 --> 00:00:27,764
(Random woman:)Excuse me,
do you know anything about this stuff?

11
00:00:27,933 --> 00:00:30,143
(Sheldon:)I know everything about this stuff.

12
00:00:30,311 --> 00:00:32,941
(Woman:)Okay, I have my own
wholesale flower business.

13
00:00:33,105 --> 00:00:35,105
I wanna hook up my computer
in the front...

14
00:00:35,274 --> 00:00:37,274
(Woman:)...with the one
in my refrigerated warehouse.

15
00:00:37,443 --> 00:00:39,863
Buy this one, it's the one we're getting.
Happy guy.

16
00:00:40,029 --> 00:00:41,239
(Sheldon:)No, she doesn't want that.

17
00:00:41,405 --> 00:00:45,615
She needs a point-to-point peer network
with a range extender.

18
00:00:45,785 --> 00:00:48,325
- Thank you.
- Which hard drive do I want?

19
00:00:48,496 --> 00:00:52,796
(Random guy:)- FireWire or USB?
- It depends on what bus you have available.

20
00:00:56,504 --> 00:01:00,024
(Guy:)I drive a Chevy Cavalier.

